Astryx
------
Official repository: https://github.com/facebook/astryx
Official website: https://astryx.atmeta.com/
Reference commit: c3016f8f054b917cdaa1d888c8023426521adfb6
Astryx Core and CLI package version: 0.6.5

This project uses Astryx Core components and generated styles, and adapts code
from the official Astryx documentation site at the reference commit above:

- apps/docsite/src/themes/astryxTheme.ts
  The official website theme, adapted in src/site-theme.mjs.
- apps/docsite/src/components/blog/BlogCoverArt.tsx
  Decorative fallback blog cover artwork, adapted in src/cover-art.jsx.
- apps/docsite/src/components/logos.tsx
  Astryx mark geometry, adapted in src/brand.jsx and the cover artwork.

The official blog and shared navigation components also informed the Hugo
adaptation. Astryx names and marks identify the source design system; this
notice does not imply sponsorship or endorsement by Meta.

